meta {
  name: List Referral Panel Settings (Filters)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/referral-panel-settings?page=1&limit=20&clientType=POSTPAID&status=ACTIVE&search=Standard&branchId=
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  clientType: POSTPAID
  status: ACTIVE
  search: Standard
  branchId:
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

tests {
  test("200 OK", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(200);
  });
}

docs {
  Paginated list of referral panel settings templates in the caller's tenant
  (newest first). Always scoped by tenant; optionally narrowed to one branch.

  ## Filters

  - `branchId` — exact-match branch filter. Branch Admin passes the active branch
    id (from the JWT) to see only that branch's settings; tenant-level (`null`)
    rows are excluded. Business Admin omits it to list every branch's settings.
  - `clientType` — `CASH` | `PREPAID` | `POSTPAID`.
  - `status` — `ACTIVE` | `INACTIVE`.
  - `search` — case-insensitive match against `settingName`. Whitespace-only
    values are ignored.

  All four are optional and combine (AND). Omit them to list everything.

  ## Pagination

  - `page` (default 1) / `limit` (default 20, max 100). Pagination info lands in
    `meta` (`total` / `page` / `limit` / `totalPages`).
}
